<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Hi&amp;Low 6-mth net falls 16.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Hi&amp;Low 6-mth net falls 16.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		     (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  38.78   vs	  46.56</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)	6.42   vs	   7.70</p>
<p>    Turnover		   168.45   vs	 196.20</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    57.56   vs	  69.63</p>
<p>    Minorities		    -     vs	    -</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	    6.80   vs	   2.64</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	 5.0    vs	   5.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Highlands &amp; Lowlands Bhd is involved in plantations and property businesses.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
